Derived from Create (The Create Team / Creators of Create):

  block/soulstained_axis.png              from create:block/axis
  block/soulstained_axis_top.png          from create:block/axis_top
  block/soulstained_cogwheel_axis.png     from create:block/cogwheel_axis
  block/obsidiansteel_cogwheel.png        from create:block/cogwheel
  block/p_grid_back.png                   from create:block/brass_gearbox
  block/p_controller_side.png             from create:block/rotation_speed_controller
  block/p_controller_side_off.png         from create:block/rotation_speed_controller
  block/external_reader_front.png         from create:block/threshold_switch_front
  block/external_reader_side.png          from create:block/threshold_switch/level_0
  block/external_reader_side_glow_a.png   from create:block/threshold_switch/level_5
  block/external_reader_side_glow_b.png   from create:block/threshold_switch/level_5
  block/external_reader_side_glow_full.png  from create:block/threshold_switch/level_5

  The External Reader's front moves Create's own pixels rather than repainting
  them: the indicator square is hue-rotated red to purple with saturation and
  value untouched, and the ring around it is scaled down in value alone. The
  three side glow layers carry only the lit pixels of Create's level indicator,
  hue-rotated onto this mod's two screen colours.

  The two controller side textures are Create's own with 50 pixels replaced by
  Refined Storage's (10 for the paired L's, 40 for the insert).

  The grid front faces below are flattened composites and contain Create pixels
  too - create:block/railway_casing_side forms the brass frame and recess under
  the Refined Storage screen:

  block/p_grid_front.png                  block/p_grid_front_off.png
  block/p_crafting_grid_front.png         block/p_crafting_grid_front_off.png

  Each is a luminance remap: Create's shading is preserved and only the palette
  is replaced. Models additionally reference Create's own models and textures by
  path at runtime (parent "create:block/cogwheel", and the controller and grid
  models take Create's own models as their parent).

Palettes taken from:

  Malum (soul stained steel)               - soulstained_*
  Forbidden & Arcanus (obsidiansteel)      - obsidiansteel_cogwheel


